> Please tell me, what are the tips for not starving ? What races eat the
> fewest ? What are the common death causes for your games ?

All races need the same amount of food. The most important tip for not
starving is to #pray. Wait until you are starving or fainting, then pray.
Don't use your prayers for anything else, unless you expect to die in the
next turn by another reason.

> Is it easy to be a tourist in nethack ? (I never tried, I will in my
> next game)

Well, playing a tourist will at least solve your food problem, but apart
from that, it's a difficult class for new players. The general opinion
here seems to be that valkyries are the easiest class for beginners.

Spellcasters are somewhat more difficult, except perhaps for priests, who
have the enormous beginner's advantage that they'll recognise which items
are cursed.

